OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy in
OL,6,Fthe evening with frequent showers at
OL,7,Ffirst, these becoming lighter and more
OL,8,Fisolated through the evening and
OL,9,Fovernight, allowing some clear spells
OL,10,Fto develop. Patchy frost.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FA few light showers around at
OL,13,Ffirst. Otherwise a dry day with sunny
OL,14,Fspells and light winds.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FCloudy
OL,17,Fon Monday with patchy rain. Early rain
OL,18,Fclearing on Tuesday then sunshine and
OL,19,Fblustery showers. Cloudy and windy on
OL,20,FWednesday with persistent and
OL,21,Foccasionally heavy rain later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
